-- ============================================================
-- AI School - finance import from AI_School.xlsx (version of 2026-10-10 evening)
-- Needs migration 0016_accounting_core (starts automatically with the backend).
-- Creates: coded chart of expense accounts (5100-5730), staff departments + staff
-- (paid per delivered work - no fixed salary), 85 approved expenses, 5 partner
-- transfers and 1 subscription-revenue entry.
-- Payroll rule: a month's pay is transferred during the NEXT month. Every payroll
-- expense therefore carries period_month = the month it belongs to, and the
-- accounting module accrues it at the end of that month. The difference between the
-- transferred amount and the payroll sheet (17.00 / 17.25) is booked separately as
-- an international transfer fee (account 5710); other differences stay in the
-- payment's notes for the accountant to review.
-- Expected: expenses 74121.62 SAR, funding 72942.00 SAR, revenue 4640.00 SAR.
-- Safe to run once: it stops if the import already exists. To redo it:
--   DELETE FROM expense_versions WHERE expense_id IN (SELECT id FROM expenses WHERE source = 'import_xlsx');
--   DELETE FROM expenses WHERE source = 'import_xlsx';
--   DELETE FROM finance_funding WHERE source = 'import_xlsx';
--   DELETE FROM finance_revenues WHERE source = 'import_xlsx';
-- TAKE A DB BACKUP FIRST.
-- ============================================================
